pany bonds have their own book. Net bought is the quarterly transactions; price and other changes is the change in holdings minus what was bought. The split by kind of holder starts in March 2013; before that only the total is published, and the full table keeps it. Source: European Central Bank and Eurostat, Quarterly Sector Accounts. Shares of the total, remainders and groupings are our calculations, and the ECB and Eurostat are not responsible for them."}